  2368 00001B2C [521CC0FF]          <1>         dd      dllname-IB              ; Name
  2369 00001B30 [601CC0FF]          <1>         dd      iat-IB                  ; FirstThunk: the IAT
  2370 00001B34 00<rep 14h>         <1>         times   20 db 0                 ; the null entry that ends the list
